## Summary
Glucksmann, a social democratic candidate, made his first official campaign trip in Charente-Maritime alongside environmentalist Jadot, showcasing their new alliance. The campaign emphasizes climate change as a core issue, aiming to integrate environmental concerns into political strategy.

## Key Points
- Glucksmann has officially declared his candidacy and initiated campaigning.
- He formed an alliance with environmentalist Jadot, merging social democratic and ecological agendas.
- Climate change is prioritized as the central theme of the campaign.
- The event highlights regional political activities in Charente-Maritime.


